  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act4d0_level_act4d0_st04",
  "groupId": "act4d0",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "存續公正",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act4d0/level_act4d0_st04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "94fac59194b4601439292eea4fe7abe47a05cb1faea2a3bcfdb935489e796c07",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "♪你是否聽聞一聲驚雷？\n♪雨成簾，不見山\n♪我早已忘記是何人何物\n♪將我引領入此道\n♪遠方的紅色的雲啊\n♪帶我回到故鄉"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_towerinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "10:37 A.M.    天氣/多雲\n敘拉古天災低發區，荒野，某林中小屋"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經聽見了歌聲，躲藏是不必要的，我沒有惡意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......每個劊子手都是這麼說的。但最後，總是見血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "劊子手？我不明白你的用詞。我是拉特蘭公證所——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閉嘴！你騙不了我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得手了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "並沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "失禮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "目標翻窗逃走，反應相當迅速。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "環境確認。醃製的羽獸肉，鞣製用的架子，處理過的牙獸皮，手工小刀和木質工具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放下弓。我清楚你的位置，你埋伏在窗後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "重申一遍，我對你沒有惡意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的警戒心很強。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘗嘗這一箭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抓，用手抓住了箭身？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼會......你究竟是什麼人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誠如報告所說，遺囑繼承人暴躁排外，難以交流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "以上就是本人遺囑的全部內容。\n除此之外，我有一條出於私心的請求。\n在敘拉古的森林之中，我遇到了一位獨臂的沃爾珀少女。\n她沉溺在對過去的復仇之中，拘泥於那片染血的土地。\n出於憐憫，我幫助了她，也許這傷害到了她的自尊，但她倔強的求生方式的確感動了我。\n後來我意識到，我一時興起的援助，不過是堅定了她復仇的執念，這讓我寢食難安。\n所以我想把我的一切贈送給她，儘管我幾乎一無所有，只剩那麼點可悲的遺物。\n——恕我打斷一下，您的親屬列表裡沒有沃爾珀人。這會為我們的工作帶來很多麻煩。\n所以，這只是一位膝下無子的拉特蘭公民，在將死之際向公證所提出的小小請求。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（他的身上，有血的氣味，而且，有股討厭的感覺......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（又是來破壞我們家園的人嗎，討厭，好討厭！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上鉤了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來如此，又是個陷阱。似乎各個方位都有觸發機關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽著！你已經走進了獵人的陷阱，不想死的話，就把你的武器放下，一步也不要動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果能方便交流，可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是什麼人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特蘭公證所的執行者，本次的遺囑執行人。可以稱呼我“送葬人”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特蘭......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“紅雲”，你是被委託的對象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你為什麼會知道我的名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的名字由遺囑人狄倫馬特先生告知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不認識這個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出於某些原因，他曾使用多個化名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要帶我去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出於保密要求，我不能說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘁，滿嘴謊話！你就死在這裡吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是不會離開這兒的，我的爸爸媽媽，叔叔阿姨，還有朋友，我的族人，都，都......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的任務只是帶你離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別說傻話了！你知道自己的處境嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我處在無法進行交涉的情況下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，走進這片森林的，都只會是我們的獵物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你腳下的骨頭，原本都是些野獸和壞人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "理解。據點周圍佈滿陷阱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "落穴，絆索，土製地雷，自動飛鏢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請放心，我已經全部解除了。陷阱很初級，有傷到委託對象你的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請跟我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！走開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再往前一步，我就射穿你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又逃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你為什麼要救我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老獵人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟我也是個獵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老獵人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看到一位可敬的同行失去了一隻臂膀，血肉模糊地躺在一隻牙獸的身邊，我怎麼能視而不見呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......你根本不是獵人，你騙不了我。你身上沒有泥土的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老獵人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，瞞不過你，但親眼目睹那副景象的時候，我被年幼卻征服了荒野的你感動了，這是實話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老獵人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是我的自言自語。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你腦袋上的那個圓，還有背後的裝飾，是怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老獵人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小傢伙，你沒見過拉特蘭人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老獵人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是......我拋卻的故土給我留下的印記。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人是沒辦法拋棄家鄉的泥土的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老獵人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許吧，總之，發生了很多事，來，試著站起身來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老獵人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我來幫你裝上這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是......？胳膊？鐵做的胳膊？好奇怪的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老獵人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "代表我對一位荒野之子的敬意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是個修東西的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老獵人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很久以前的職責讓我學會了很多東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你救過我，你不是個壞人。為了報仇，我很需要一隻胳膊，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老獵人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "復仇嗎......我不會指點你的命運。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老獵人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但當你用這隻手臂拉動弓弦的時候，你可以想想，除了報仇以外，我們是為什麼活著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老獵人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想得少了，就會淪落到我今天這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老獵人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要說什麼“為了復仇而活”，這太老套了，很沒意思的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老獵人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒錯，很沒意思的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（拉特蘭......他說他是拉特蘭人......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（難道他真的是......)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔！又來，好痛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來狄倫馬特先生的判斷是正確的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惡，你是什麼時候追到這裡的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔！放開我！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "停手吧，既然你是遺囑繼承人，我就不能傷害你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是他的信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼還要抵抗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......信上有他的氣味，血的氣味，你對他做了什麼！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從拉特蘭抵達這裡的旅程非常漫長，氣味分子不可能有所保留。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回答我！否則你會死在這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "首先，我認為展示力量差距有助於對話成立。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其次，出於對遺囑繼承人的尊重，我可以回答你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "狄倫馬特先生死在手術台上，並不安詳。他身患一種無法治癒的疾病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——！鬆手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是他的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！你，你在幹嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石已經破體而出，感染程度在加劇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不關你事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果執行對象堅持拒絕，原則上，我可以放棄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但委託人和上司給予了我一個附屬條約，我必須執行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你到底要怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“讓紅雲活下去”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但因為要求籠統，所以實行起來很複雜，希望你能配合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這也是那個人的委託？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。他變賣了所有的財產，支付了包括公證所的額外手續費，以及你將來的治療開銷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，為什麼？他只是路過這片森林......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他想讓你活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我問為什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為他覺得你值得活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然遺囑已經傳達到位，我的工作就告一段落了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什......！你什麼時候塞給我的——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在下一步行動前，我必須聽到你的答覆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“你想活下去嗎？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只要回答，想，或是不想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的時間不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "對了，先生，我該怎麼稱呼你？\n——送葬人。如果你執意要稱呼我的話。\n非常感謝你願意接受我的委託。\n——是中庭公證所做出了決定，我只是履行職責。\n哈哈，也是。在你尋找紅雲的過程中，我還有一個小小的請求。\n——視情況，我可能會拒絕你的口頭訴求。希望你以紙面申請的形式遞交公證所。\n先生可真是不留情面，沒關係，只是一個小小的要求。\n不要告訴她關於我的過去，隨便編個藉口吧，比如，我死在了手術台上？\n——我不明白這其中的必要性，這也不符合你的身份。你逃避公證所多年，而且你槍殺了......\n打住。如果我說，這能為你的工作省去很多麻煩呢？\n——如果我判斷的確如此的話，我會考慮嘗試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_towerinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......所以，那個叫羅德島的地方，真的能治療這種奇怪的病？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有人能夠抵抗礦石病。但也許可以緩解痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "考慮到你先前對那些烏薩斯人所做的一切，我不建議你單獨行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我正好要去羅德島履行另一份協議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是在邀請我和你同行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我認為這十分合理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，我拒絕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還有很多事情要做，在離開這片土地之前，我要與族人們道別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡很危險，仇恨並不會因為一方的妥協而終結。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......你知道得很清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論你怎麼說，別妨礙我。等到一切結束，我會去那個......羅德島的，這樣就行了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在考慮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "考慮如果那些亡命之徒再次找到你，我的子彈儲備是否充足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "子彈......？不，你的意思是要陪著我回到荒漠！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "根據你的回答，你已被公證所視作接受遺囑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但遺囑內容尚未履行完成，我不能放任你就這麼暴露在危險中。這是我的義務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不需要你的幫助！我一直都是一個人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及，我認為你有故意妥協，然後趁機逃走的可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼事不宜遲，我們出發吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！我沒有答應你！我不需要你這種外人來......等等，你要去哪兒？你怎麼知道那個方向的！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "調查的結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你腳下有——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送葬人",
      "speakerId": "char_279_excu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經解除了陷阱，請跟上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerId": "char_190_clour",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊——你這個怪人，我遲早要讓你好看——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "請一定要照顧好她，送葬人先生。當然，也許對你而言也是一件好事。\n別擺出一副不理解的表情，你會明白的。\n希望你們能讓她脫離泥濘。別讓她像我一樣。\n正義？也許我的所作所為是有正當性的吧，先生，如果公證所能夠諒解我的話。\n但那依舊不是什麼值得稱讚的事情，相反，正因如此，才讓人生顯得荒謬之極。\n但她是我的遺產。\n是我的希望。\n願主保佑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
